To ensure VPNv4 prefixes propagate over IPv6 transport with an IPv6 next-hop on Nokia 7750 SR routers, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    advertise-ipv6-next-hops vpn-ipv4
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family vpn
                    resolution filter
                        type <ipv6-tunnel-type>  # Specify the IPv6 tunnel type (e.g., ldp, rsvp, sr)
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
```

