- Apply this template to all route reflectors in the same redundancy group
- Maintain consistent location IDs across the route reflection infrastructure
- Use unique cluster IDs per geographical location group
- Replace bracketed placeholders (`< >`) with actual device IPs/router IDs
- For client diversity, create separate groups with distinct cluster/location IDs per geographical zone

