To implement granular prefix-based inbound and outbound filtering for BGP neighbors on your Nokia 7750 SR routers while maintaining existing routing policies, use the following CLI configuration template. This enables BGP Outbound Route Filtering (ORF) with prefix-based controls at the neighbor level:

```
configure router bgp
