        neighbor <neighbor_IP_address>
            outbound-route-filtering
                prefix
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key adjustments needed**:
1. Replace `<peer_group_name>` with your BGP peer group name
2. Replace `<neighbor_IP_address>` with the specific neighbor's IP address
3. Apply this configuration to all relevant BGP neighbors

